@startuml View Banner Detail Sequence Diagram
title UC-BN02 - View Banner Detail

actor "Admin" as User
participant "Banner\nGovernance Page" as Frontend
participant ":bannerRoutes" as Routes
participant ":bannerController" as Controller
participant ":bannerService" as Service
participant "Banner\nModel" as Model
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> Frontend: 1. Click "View Detail" on a banner
Frontend -> Routes: 2. GET /api/banners/:id\n(Bearer Token)

ref over Routes
Verify JWT Token and Admin Role
end ref
Routes -> Routes: 3. Check authentication/authorization result
opt [Authentication or authorization failed]
  Routes --> Frontend: 4. JSON error response (401/403)
  Frontend --> User: 5. Show error
end

Routes -> Controller: 6. getBannerById(req, res)
Controller -> Service: 7. getBannerById(id)
Service -> Model: 8. findById(id).populate("canteenId")
Model -> DB: 9. Query banner by id
DB --> Model: 10. Banner document or null
Model --> Service: 11. Query result

Service -> Service: 12. Check whether banner exists
opt [Banner not found]
  Service -> Service: 12.1 throw AppError("Banner not found", 404)
  Service --> Controller: 12.2 HTTP 404
  Controller --> Routes: 12.3 JSON error
  Routes --> Frontend: 12.4 JSON error response
  Frontend --> User: 12.5 Show error
end

Service --> Controller: 13. Return banner
Controller --> Routes: 14. HTTP 200
Routes --> Frontend: 15. JSON response\n{ status: "success", data: { banner } }

Frontend -> Frontend: 16. Open detail drawer/modal
Frontend --> User: 17. Display banner detail

@enduml
